# Trivy vulnerability suppressions
# See: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/

# System library vulnerabilities in CI environment dependencies
# These are transitive dependencies of GitHub Actions runners, not direct
# dependencies of this Python project. The Python SDK/CLI does not:
# - Parse XML files (libxml2/libexpat vulnerabilities not exploitable)
# - Use audio libraries (libasound vulnerabilities not exploitable)
# - Have no fixed versions available upstream yet

